# Project identity

civica.uk identifies the theme project, this documentation site and promotional material. It is not a required identity inside a household or business interface. People can keep a plain title or use their own name, crest or logo. See [Personalise your home](../get-started/personalisation.html).

The repository name is retained for continuity; it does not authorise GOV.UK branding. This page keeps its earlier URL for existing links.


## Project identity and interface styles

Read [colour](brand-colour.html), [typography](brand-typography.html), [data](brand-data.html) and [illustration](illustration.html) as interface-design guidance. This page governs supplied civica.uk artwork only when identifying or promoting the project. The official graphic device, logo system and brand-in-use material are outside this work package; do not import their identity assets.


